          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这会从 LlamaDock 的托管运行时目录中永久移除 %@。当前和上一个运行时始终会保留，以确保服务连续性和支持回滚。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This repository requires a Hugging Face token with access. Add one in Settings; LlamaDock has not sent any credentials." : {
